\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand: Baht Ends Down In Spot Mkt On  \highlight22\uc2 Central-Bank \highlight\uc2  Turmoil \b0\par\par\uc2 299 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par 12:36\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--The Thai baht slipped against the U.S. dollar in spot trading Thursday as investors rushed to buy the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on reports of political turmoil within the Bank of Thailand. \par \par \uc2  But the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  finished mixed in the swap market, where investors make agreements to buy and sell dollars at specified times in the future. One-month and one-year premiums declined, but three-month premiums rose. \par \par \uc2  At the close of trading Thursday, the dollar was at 25.953 baht, up from 25.948 baht at the close of trading Wednesday. The Bank of Thailand set its mid-rate for the dollar at 25.93 baht, down from 25.94 baht Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The dollar's level indicated \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 , since the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  opened and finished outside the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  range. That obligated the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell dollars at below-market rates to Thai commercial banks. The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band Thursday was 25.91 baht to 25.95 baht. \par \par \uc2  Dealers attributed the dollar-buying partly to the government's decision Wednesday to suspend a deputy \b \highlight22\uc2 central-bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor, Jaroong Nookhwun, accusing him of bungling efforts to prosecute a former president of the scandal-tainted Bangkok Bank of Commerce PCL. That sparked rumors that Rerngchai Marakanonda, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central-bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor had resigned. The Bank of Thailand denied the rumors. \par \par \uc2  Rerngchai called a press conference Thursday to assure investors that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's independence hadn't been compromised. 'Our monetary policy and financial-institutions supervision remain unchanged regardless of the suspension order,' although he said \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  employees had been demoralized by the government's decision. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 06-03-97 \par \par \uc2  1136GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt3601m7q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
