\par\par \b \uc2  Thai baht firms on BOT talk, interbank drops late. \b0\par\par\uc2 231 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Februar 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Feb 11 (Reuter) - The Thai baht firmed against the U.S. dollar in late trade on Tuesday on talk of the possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  to ease selling pressure against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The baht rose sharply in late afternoon after heavy selling of the dollar. There was talk about the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but I cannot confirm," said one dealer at a European bank. \par \par \uc2  The baht was traded at 25.925/25.935 to the dollar late against 25.940/25.945 early, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The downward trend of the interbank rate will continue as some money still flowed back to the system. But the fall will also depend on how there is buying of the dollar," said one money market dealer. \par \par \uc2  The baht/dollar swap premiums rose to 14.50/15.50 satangs per a dollar late from 15.00/16.00 in the morning trade. \par \par \uc2  BOT governor Rerngchai Marakanond re-emphasised on Tuesday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would use a high interest policy to curb speculators. The BOT and the finance ministry also denied a wire service report that changes may be made to the current four-satang trading range of the baht against the dollar between the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and comercial banks. \par \par \uc2  -- Anuchit Nguyen (662) 652-0642 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dt2b00hzd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\p