\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Thailand \highlight\uc2  Baht Up In Early Spot Mkt;  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervenes \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 288 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Januar 1997\par 04:07\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--The Thai baht is up in early Asian spot trading Friday, boosted by strong dollar-selling as the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is eager to defend the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from false devaluation rumors, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, continues to weaken in the swap market, where investors agree to buy and sell dollars at specified times in the future. Swap premiums are rising amid a continuing rush to buy dollars on the devaluation rumors. \par \par \uc2  Around 0235 GMT, the dollar is at 25.803 baht, down from 25.812 baht Thursday. The Bank of Thailand set its midrate for the dollar at 25.78 baht, down from 25.79 baht on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market remains dollar-bullish, following rumors of an imminent devaluation of the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  late Wednesday. The rumors, first reported by the financial-information service Technical Data, triggered a sell-off in the baht, pushing the dollar to an intraday high of 25.830 baht around 0300 GMT Thursday. \par \par \uc2  'A lot of people are still nervous,' said a dealer at a U.S. bank in Bangkok. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Thailand attributed the rumors to traders' misunderstanding of recent comments by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's deputy governor, Chaiyawat Wibulswasdi. Chaiyawat has warned Thai businesses with U.S-dollar risks to hedge those risks because of the danger of big fluctuations in the exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  responded to the rumors by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in spot trading both domestically and in Singapore. The \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued Friday, they said. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, hasn't confirmed or denied the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 24-01-97 \par \par \uc2  0307GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1o00l57\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
