\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Thailand \highlight\uc2  Baht Ends Up In Spot Mkt After  \highlight22\uc2 Interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 344 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Januar 1997\par 12:04\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--The Thai baht rose slightly in Asian spot trading Friday, boosted by dollar-selling by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against devaluation rumors, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  But the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined in the swap market, where investors make agreements to buy and sell dollars at specified times in the future. Swap premiums rose sharply as investors bought dollars to hedge their exposure to the rising U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At the close of spot trading Friday, the dollar was 25.806 baht, down from 25.812 baht at the close of trading Thursday. The Bank of Thailand, meanwhile, fixed its mid-rate for the dollar at 25.78 baht, down from 25.79 baht Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against false rumors that the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  faced imminent devaluation. The rumors, first reported late Wednesday, caused a sell-off in the baht although \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  helped prop up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Still, investors continued to buy dollars in the swap market. 'It seems local importers are buying dollars to hedge their exposure,' a dealer at a U.S. bank said. Thailand's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in recent statements, had advised importers to do just that. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Swap premiums rose sharply as a result. At the close of trading, swap\par rates were as follows, in satang (1 baht equals 100 satang):\par       Friday      Thursday    Wednesday   Tuesday\par 1 mo. 9.0-9.50    8.0-8.5     8.6-9.0     9.0-9.40\par 2 mo. 16.75-17.55 16.0-16.5   15.5-16.5   16.5-17.0\par 3 mo. 24.75-25.5  23.0-23.75  22.75-23.25 23.1-24.0\par 6 mo. 46.5-47.0   44.0-44.5   43.25-44.25 44.5-45.25\par 1 yr. 88.0-89.5   84.0-86.0   82.0-85.0   84.0-85.0\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 24-01-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1104GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1o00g0f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
