\par\par \b \uc2  Thai baht ends firmer on  \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 214 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Dezember 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Dec 24 (Reuter) - The Thai baht firmed against the dollar in late afternoon trade after the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the morning to cap the dollar rise at its daily fixing rate, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The baht firmed to 25.593-25.598 to the dollar near the close from 25.600-25.605 in early morning trade. The Bank of Thailand fixed the dollar/baht mid-rate unchanged at 25.57. \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was detected in the morning. They may want the spot dollar/baht rate to ease lower," said a dealer at a foreign bank. \par \par \uc2  Senior \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials were not available for comment on the bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said overall market activities remained thin as most palyers were sidelined by the festive season. \par \par \uc2  "I almost do nothing today and the market will be much more quiet tomorrow," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The overnight interbank rate was steady at 12.75-13.00 percent late on Tuesday against 12.50-13.00 earlier. \par \par \uc2  The one-month dollar/baht swap premium was quoted at 10.25/ 11.00 satangs per dollar late against 9.50/10.00 in the morning. \par \par \uc2  -- Anuchit Nguyen (662) 652-0642 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011019dsco01ss5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
