\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand Baht Dn In Early Trading As Dlr-Buying Resumes \b0\par\par\uc2 362 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Dezember 1996\par 04:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--The Thai baht is down in early spot trading Thursday as investors, worried about the Thai economy, resume dollar-buying, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has also weakened slightly in the swap market, where investors make agreements to buy and sell baht at specified times in the future. Two-month, three-month and one-year premiums are up. \par \par \uc2  Around 0306 GMT, the dollar was at 25.593 baht, up from 25.583 baht at the close of trading Wednesday. The Bank of Thailand, meanwhile, fixed its mid-rate for the dollar at 25.55 baht, unchanged from Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was rumored to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in Singapore. The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  refused to confirm or deny that. \par \par \uc2  Investors who had been dumping baht in favor of dollars paused briefly on Wednesday, after Finance Minister Amnuay Viravan said he believed the baht was undervalued, defusing worries of a possible devaluation. \par \par \uc2  Moreover, in an interview published Thursday in the Asian Wall Street Journal, Amnuay said Thailand isn't currently considering a change in the exchange-rate system although a change 'may be permissible when our economy becomes stable.' \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the resumption of dollar-buying had pushed interbank rates up. The overnight rate is quoted at 14.75%, up from 14.5% Wednesday. The call rate is quoted at 15%, up from 14.75% Wednesday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Swap rates are as follows, in satang (1 baht equals 100 satang).\par        Thursday    Wednesday    Tuesday     Monday\par 1 mo.  11.0-11.5   11.0-11.5    12.0-13.0   11.25-11.75\par 2 mo.  19.75-20.75 19.5-19.75   19.25-21.0  19.0-19.75\par 3 mo.  27.75-28.75 27.5-28.5    26.75-27.75 26.25-27.0\par 6 mo.  48.5-49.5   48.5-49.5    47.5-48.0   46.5-47.5\par 1 yr.  88.0-91.0   86.0-89.0    87.0-90.0   86.0-89.0\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-12-96\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0322GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dscj01x39\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
