\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand Baht Ends Up In Swap Market As Dlr-Buying Ebbs \b0\par\par\uc2 389 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Dezember 1996\par 12:34\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--The Thai baht perked up in Asian swap trading Thursday after rumors of a \b \highlight22\uc2 central-bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  blunted the urge of investors to sell baht in favor of U.S. dollars, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  But the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell in the spot market, hurt by the dollar's advance against the Japanese yen and the Deutsche mark - \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to which the baht is pegged. \par \par \uc2  At the close of trading, the dollar was at 25.599 baht, up from 25.583 baht late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Investors in the swap market make agreements to buy and sell dollars at specificied times in the future. Dealers said investors, worried by the health of the Thai economy, had been selling baht and buying dollars until the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  reportedly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'Because of the strong \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the buying of dollars against the Thai baht has cooled,' a dealer at the Bank of Tokyo said. He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was rumored to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the dollar climbed to 25.594 baht, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to confirm or deny an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Swap rates, or the premium investors pay over the spot rate, had been rising before the rumored \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The two-month rate rose to 19.75-20.75 satang, from 19.5-19.75 at the end of Wednesday. The one-year rate climbed to 88.0-91.0 satang from 86.0-89.0 satang late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par By the end of trading, however, many of the rates had fallen as\par dollar-buying tapered off. Swap rates ended as follows, in satang (1\par baht equals 100 satang).\par        Thursday    Wednesday    Tuesday     Monday\par 1 mo.  11.0-11.5   11.0-11.5    12.0-13.0   11.25-11.75\par 2 mo.  18.75-19.75 19.5-19.75   19.25-21.0  19.0-19.75\par 3 mo.  26.75-27.5  27.5-28.5    26.75-27.75 26.25-27.0\par 6 mo.  48.0-48.75  48.5-49.5    47.5-48.0   46.5-47.5\par 1 yr.  86.0-90.0   86.0-89.0    87.0-90.0   86.0-89.0\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-12-96\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1134GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dscj01sdi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
