\par\par \b \uc2  Thai baht, interbank rate steady in late trade. \b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Dezember 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Dec 18 (Reuter) - The Thai baht held steady in late Wednesday trade as tightened baht supply and high short-term Thai interest rates curbed demand for dollar, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Dollar buying eased relatively today because short-term Thai interest rates are very high," said a dealer at a major Thai bank. \par \par \uc2  Another dealer at a European bank said moderate dollar buying in the afternoon was not as strong as in the past few days. "(Dollar) buying side was very thin today. They may fear possible \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar/baht mid-rate unchanged from Tuesday at 25.55. \par \par \uc2  The overnight interbank rate was largely steady at 14.75-15.00 percent in late trade against 14.50-15.00 in the morning, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said money supply remained tight following heavy dollar buying in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and ahead of a deadline for commercial banks to meet \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserve requirement later this week. \par \par \uc2  "The market continued seeing strong borrowings. Some fund injection through the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's bond repurchase window slowed the rise in interbank rates," said a dealer at a foreign bank. \par \par \uc2  The one-month dollar/baht swap premium was quoted at 11.00/12.00 satangs per dollar on late Wednesday against 10.50/11.25 in the morning. \par \par \uc2  -- Anuchit Nguyen (662) 652-0642 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011019dsci024kw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shp