ighlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ?' he asked. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 18-09-96 \par \par \uc2  0847GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds9i07jf0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
