\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Thailand Central Bank \highlight\uc2  -2: Won't Change  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Policy \b0\par\par\uc2 333 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 August 1996\par 10:50\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  stabilized the baht, but it didn't restore investors' confidence in the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Last week investors continued to sell baht in favor of dollars, and the Bank of Thailand continued to pump money into the Thai repurchase market to ease a credit crunch. Last week alone, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  injected more than $1 billion into the repo market. \par \par \uc2  'Almost every Friday now, there are rumors that the baht is going to be devalued over the weekend, even while I am here talking to you,' Rerngchai told traders attending the annual \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  Southeast Asian forum here. 'Similar stories were also frequently heard whenever I happened to call a staff meeting or a press conference ... It seems to me that the stories are getting more and more innovative every day.' \par \par \uc2  Rerngchai said he wanted to put the rumors to rest 'once and for all.' The Bank of Thailand, he said, will not change its exchange-rate policy in the forseeable future - not by a devaluation, not by widening the band in which it allows the dollar to trade versus the baht, and not by reconfiguring the 'basket' of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to which the baht is pegged. 'Let me state once again that we are satisfied with the present level of exchange rate and the present exchange-rate arrangement,' he said. \par \par \uc2  The International Monetary Fund, in a confidential June report, said that Thailand's monetary controls were growing increasingly weak. It argued that Thailand's only hope for an 'enduring improvement' in those controls lay in a change in the system - either by widening the baht band or by changing the basket. \par \par \uc2  Rerngchai acknowledged that recommendation Saturday. 'We do take note of their views in our monitoring of the economic situation, and in our review of policy options for the future. As of now we feel what we have done and achieved has been appropriate.' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 17-08-96 \par \par \uc2  0850GMT \par \par \uc2  1141 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds8h06o8a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
