\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Warns  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Traders On Baht Attacks \b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 August 1996\par 09:27\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  PHUKET, Thailand (AP-Dow Jones)--In the aftermath of Thailand's worst \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis in 19 months, the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central-bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor on Saturday warned Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders not to test the bank's strength in defending the baht. \par \par \uc2  Rerngchai Marakanond, in his first meeting with more than 100 traders from Southeast Asian countries, said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  had jettisoned a historic policy of 'defensive' \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  In the future, he said, the bank will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  not just in the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, but in overseas markets as well - and not just in the forward markets, but in spot markets as well. \par \par \uc2  'While we don't want to be tested, we are certainly prepared - and equipped - to do whatever is necessary to preserve the value of our \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' Rerngchai said. 'An attack on the baht will thus be considered a direct attack on the Bank of Thailand, and it will be dealt with accordingly.' \par \par \uc2  Thailand last month suffered the worst run on the baht since the Mexican peso crisis of 1994, a result of rumors that the country was about to devalue the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stimulate flagging exports. The Bank of Thailand used up more than $1 billion of its $39.8 billion in foreign reserves to prop up the baht. It also \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the first time in forward markets in Hong Kong and Singapore. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 17-08-96 \par \par \uc2  0727GMT \par \par \uc2  1141 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds8h06o74\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
