\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand Baht Up In Early Trading As Dlr Slumps Vs Yen \b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 August 1996\par 04:46\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--The Thai baht is up against the dollar in early Asian trading Tuesday, buoyed by the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decline against the Japanese yen. \par \par \uc2  Around 0232 GMT, the U.S. dollar was trading at 25.283 baht in the spot market, down from 25.293 baht at the close of trading Thursday. The Bank of Thailand lowered its midrate for the dollar to 25.28 baht from 25.29 baht Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The baht is pegged to a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  that includes the dollar, the yen and the Deutsche mark. Dealers said the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  gained partly as a result of the dollar's decline against the yen and the mark late Thursday, which prompted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to lower its midrate. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at 107.93 yen in New York trading Thursday, down from 108.12 yen Wednesday. It closed at 1.4857 marks, down from 1.4897 marks Wednesday. Around 0237 GMT, the dollar was at 107.68 yen and 1.4865 marks. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said, moreover, that repeated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  was beginning to show results in bolstering the baht and lowering interbank rates. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  injected 14 billion baht into the repurchase market Thursday and canceled a 3-billion baht bond auction scheduled for Friday. \par \par \uc2  Interbank rates have declined as a result. The overnight rate is at 13%-14% Friday morning, down from 14.5% late Thursday. The call rate is also at 13%-14%, down from 15% late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-08-96 \par \par \uc2  0246GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds8g06ni7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
