\par\par \b \uc2  Thai  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  stops offshore  \highlight22\uc2 fx intervention \highlight\uc2 . [CORRECTED 09:50 GMT 6/8] \b0\par\par\uc2 285 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 August 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Aug 5 (Reuter) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOT) said it did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in offshore \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets on Monday to stabilise domestic money market liquidity, saying the market had already calmed down. (Corretcs to make clear that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday and deleting reference to future \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ). \par \par \uc2  Last week the BOT \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the Singapore and Hong Kong swap markets for the first time to reduce Thai swap interest rates and ease extremely tight domestic liquidity. \par \par \uc2  "The BOT has not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market (today) as the market has already calmed down. We will continue to closely monitor the market," assistant \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Siri Ganjarerndee told reporters. (Corrects translation to make clear official did not rule out possible future action). \par \par \uc2  Market speculation about a possible baht devaluation triggered heavy selling of baht for dollars by foreign investors at the end of July, pushing up the overnight interbank rate to an 18-month high of 24.00-26.00 percent. \par \par \uc2  Liquidity eased later after the BOT denied the devaluation rumours and implemented several monetary measures aimed at easing the tight money supply. \par \par \uc2  Siri said the BOT injected between seven and eight billion baht into the system on Monday through the bond repurchase market. \par \par \uc2  There was some dollar selling to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  by commercial banks on Monday but Siri did not give the amount. "The coming reserve requirements prompted banks to sell dollars for baht," he said. \par \par \uc2  All Thai commercial banks have to meet \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserve requirements on the seventh and 22nd of every month. \par \par \uc2  -- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds8504q9h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
