\par\par \b \uc2  Thai  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  takes new steps to calm market. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tang Nguyen \par \uc2 450 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 August 1996\par 13:16\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Aug 1 (Reuter) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOT) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the offshore swap market for the first time on Thursday in an attempt to bring down swap interest rates and to ease tight liquidity. \par \par \uc2  "The BOT \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the swap markets in Singapore and Hong Kong on Thursday morning," BOT governor Rerngchai Marakanond told a news conference. \par \par \uc2  "There were positive results from the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as swap interest rates dropped by about five percentage points," Rerngchai said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was one of three measures announced on Thursday that aim to solve the current tight money supply. \par \par \uc2  The governor said it was the first time the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a swap market abroad. Rerngchai said the decision was taken because the bank's recent injection of funds into the system was not working. \par \par \uc2  Thai money markets have been hit by tight liquidity over the past few days, with interbank rates soaring to new 18-month highs. \par \par \uc2  The BOT on Thursday also injected 10 billion baht ($400 million) into the system through the bond repurchase markets. \par \par \uc2  Another measure announced on Thursday was the decision to allow finance firms and banks to borrow funds from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  through guaranteed instruments. \par \par \uc2  Under the plan, which is effective immediately, commercial banks, finance companies and finance and securities firms can use bills of exchange and promissory notes with a maturity of no more than six months to borrow funds from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  After the measures were announced on Thursday, the interbank rate eased to 13-15 percent from 25-26 percent early. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the tight liquidity has been due to a heavy outflow of foreign funds and large amounts of dollar buying which was triggered by rumours of a possible baht devaluation. The BOT has denied it plans to devalue the baht. \par \par \uc2  From July 1-18, foreign funds showed a net inflow of $219 million, but they were expected to show a net outflow for the whole month because of the heavy dollar buying in the last week triggered by the baht devaluation rumour. \par \par \uc2  Rergnchai also said high swap premiums compounded the tight liquidity by hindering inflows of foreign funds. \par \par \uc2  The governor said the BOT \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was aimed at resolving the tight liquidity situation as soon as possible. \par \par \uc2  The BOT rarely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly in local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and money markets. The bank controls the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market through the fixing of the mid-rate and the money markets through the bond repurchase markets. \par \par \uc2  The bank will continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the swap market as long as it is necessary, Rergnchai said. \par \par \uc2  ($1.00 = 25 baht) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds8104w6z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
