\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Of Thailand/Exchange-Rate-3: Baht Moves Very Little \b0\par\par\uc2 267 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 April 1996\par 13:54\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The Thai baht is a pegged \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , its value determined from a 'basket' of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  that includes the dollar, the yen and the Deutsche mark. It has had a history of extraordinary stability, analysts say: in the last three years the dollar has traded in a range of 24.50 baht to 25.50 baht. \par \par \uc2  'If you looked at a chart of the dollar versus the baht over the last few years, you'd see just a flat line,' said Kevin Chan, an economist with Salomon Brothers in Hong Kong. \par \par \uc2  Analysts credit the Bank of Thailand for that stability. Each morning, it sets a band within which it wants the baht to trade. The exact width of the band is seldom disclosed, analysts say, but its dimensions may be guaged by the 'mid-rate' set by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  each morning. Typically, analysts say, if the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves outside a range of 1 baht, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  by buying or selling dollars. \par \par \uc2  The frequency of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is high, and the rewards usually are considerable: a stable baht attracts foreign investors, promotes Thai exports and generally helps the economy grow. As a result, analysts say, the Bank of Thailand has been loath to consider any change in the system. \par \par \uc2  'The bank has been saying the baht is sacrosanct,' said Sriyan Pietersz, an analyst with Capital Nomura Securities PCL. 'They've been saying the system will not change as long as we have a current-account deficit.' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 09-04-96 \par \par \uc2  1154GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds4902xxj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
