\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Thailand \highlight\uc2  Interbank Rates Fall; Mkt Cool To  \highlight22\uc2 Interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 309 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Januar 1996\par 06:15\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-DJ)--Thai interbank rates continued to sink Friday, apparently cool to attempts by the Bank of Thailand to tighten the money supply through a big sale of bonds this week. \par \par \uc2  The overnight interbank rate is at 6%-6.5%, down from 7%-7.25% Thursday. The call rate is at 6.5%, down from 7.5% Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Repurchase rates are also declining. The one-day rate is at 7.75%, down from 7.875% Thursday. The seven-day rate is 7.875, down from 8% Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Foreign capital inflows, which totaled $653 million in the first two weeks of January alone, have dragged down interbank rates sharply so far. That has brought down deposit rates, and even lending rates, at some banks. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Thailand, anxious to stop rates from coming down too far, this week tried to drain money out of the repurchase market by selling bonds. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold 8 billion baht worth of bonds this week, its deputy governor, Rerngchai Marakanond, told reporters Thursday. \par \par \uc2  He also said that commercial banks, in a bout of dollar-selling this week, sold about $580 million to the Bank of Thailand, which had been offering a higher rate for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  than was available on the spot market. \par \par \uc2  'There's been some \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said a dealer at the Bank of Tokyo. 'The bank didn't want commercial banks to bring their rates down too much.' \par \par \uc2  But the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't had much effect, said another dealer at the Bank of America. 'They can't absorb all the liquidity because it's simply too much,' she said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they were aware of no \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday. Rerngchai couldn't be reached for comment. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 26-01-96 \par \par \uc2  0515GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds1q00p2m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
