\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Scare/Thailand -3: Bank Of Thailand Praised \b0\par\par\uc2 297 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Februar 1995\par 02:07\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Despite the system's flaws, the Bank of Thailand gets high marks for its handling of the crisis, all agree. Sensing the liquidity shortage, it set up a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap facility on Jan. 13 that poured funds back into the market by letting banks borrow baht at between 9.5% and 10%, instead of at the higher interbank rates. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also kept its daily \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixing reassuringly steady, and took pains to keep dealers and reporters informed of its policies. \par \par \uc2  The steps were effective. Within 24 hours, as the baht's sturdiness grew apparent, some banks actually reversed course and put funds back into the market, notes a Hong Kong dealer. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Thailand acknowledges structural problems exist and says it is taking steps to remedy them. But it insists major reforms aren't needed. For example, there's no plan to change settlement rules to allow two-day payment. \par \par \uc2  But since the crisis, the bank has proposed several measures that many believe would help prevent a similar liquidity squeeze in the future. To boost liquidity in the repurchase market, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  plans to accept more types of securities, including bonds not backed by the government but issued by state-owned banks such as the Industrial Finance Corp. of Thailand, the Government Housing Bank and the Bank for Agriculture and Agricultural Cooperatives. Now, only the limited supply of government bonds or government-backed bonds of state enterprises are eligible to trade in the repurchase market. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also is considering a plan to designate a number of primary dealers through which it could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's still-small secondary bond market. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 12-02-95 \par \par \uc2  0107GMT \par \par \uc2  1136 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr2d00wno\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Thailand near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\